• Analysts Cut Targets, Buy Ratings: Analysts cut price targets for Strategy Inc Class A (MSTR): Citigroup lowered target to $136 from $260; BTIG cut target to $250 from $350. Both keep Buy ratings.
• MSTR Surges After Saylor Hints: MSTR jumped over 8% Friday after Executive Chairman Michael Saylor hinted on X at a possible Bitcoin buy; retail bullish sentiment spiked and online discussions rose.
• Le Buys 11,000 Preferred Shares: CEO Phong Le bought 11,000 Strategy Inc Class A (MSTR) preferred shares at ~$90.80 each (~$998,800); other senior execs also raised preferred and common holdings.

