KIDZ AI won the 2026 EdTechX Award for the Americas and unveiled KIDZBot, an AI-native robotics learning platform slated for commercial rollout in H2 2026.

Key Highlights:

• KIDZ AI named 2026 EdTechX Award winner for the Americas, recognizing its innovation in AI-powered education.
• KIDZBot launched as an integrated AI robotics platform combining hardware, curriculum, sensors, memory and reasoning.
• Company expects KIDZBot commercial rollout in the second half of 2026, beginning with Learning Center Robotics Program.
• KIDZBot features modular robotics, progressive coding pathways (block to Python/Java/C++), and AI-powered curriculum packages.
• KIDZ AI positions KIDZBot as an AI-native layer to expand from digital platform to broader education infrastructure and recurring deployments.

