Content:
WEST PALM BEACH, FL / ACCESS Newswire / July 6, 2026 / ELEKTROS Inc. continues to build upon its long-term vision for the electric vehicle charging sector through careful evaluation of future infrastructure opportunities. Following its review of prior patent-related correspondence, the Company is concentrating on strategic initiatives designed to support future expansion.

Management is studying approximately 10 to 15 potential charging station locations while exploring installation opportunities that remain subject to definitive agreements and customary conditions.

The Company believes the continued expansion of EV adoption creates meaningful opportunities for thoughtfully planned charging infrastructure.

"We are focused on building lasting value through disciplined planning and careful execution," said Shlomo Bleier, Chief Executive Officer of ELEKTROS Inc.

Forward-Looking Statements

This news release contains forward-looking statements that involve risks and uncertainties. Actual results may differ materially from those expressed or implied. Negotiations and proposed projects remain subject to execution of definitive agreements and customary conditions. Statements regarding potential charging-station locations, infrastructure installation, branding, market opportunities, operating plans and future growth initiatives are forward-looking and are not guarantees of future performance.

Contact Information

ELEKTROS Inc.

West Palm Beach, Florida

Phone: 786-477-9003

Email: elektrosinc@gmail.com

Website: https://elektros.energy

SOURCE: Elektros, Inc.

