• Entered exclusive worldwide licensing agreement with Argent BioPharma for CannEpil to treat drug-resistant epilepsy.
• CannEpil has established access and reimbursement in multiple markets (Ireland, UK, Germany, Australia) and EU-GMP manufacturing.
• Program has an IND and has initiated pre-IND engagement with the FDA, underpinning potential U.S. clinical development.
• Received $1 million commitment from C/M Capital Partners to fund regulatory, clinical planning and commercialization activities.
• Consideration includes forgiveness of ~$5M Argent debt and issuance of $5.5M in newly issued preferred equity; Argent retains 15% royalty on net sales.

