TORONTO, July 6, 2026 /PRNewswire/ - The Company's results for the 2026 second quarter will be issued by press release on Thursday, August 6, 2026, after the close of business at 5:00 p.m. ET.

An Investor Conference Call will be hosted by Martin L. Juravsky, Executive Vice President and Chief Financial Officer and John G. Reid, President and Chief Executive Officer on Friday, August 7, 2026, at 9:00 a.m. ET to review the results.

To join the conference call without operator assistance, you may register and enter your phone number at https://emportal.ink/3SlXM1M to receive an instant automated call back.

