Content:
MIRA Pharmaceuticals reported positive preclinical PK and formulation results for SKNY-1, showing favorable oral bioavailability and robust brain and liver exposure that support once-daily dosing potential.

Key Highlights:

• Optimized oral formulation demonstrated favorable oral bioavailability after oral administration.
• Pharmacokinetic profile showed peak plasma concentrations ~6–12 hours, supporting once-daily dosing potential.
• Robust brain penetration and substantial liver exposure observed, indicating distribution to pharmacologically relevant tissues.
• Reproducible systemic exposure and target tissue distribution across multiple animals in preclinical studies.
• Findings complement prior efficacy and behavioral data showing weight reduction, lean mass preservation, metabolic improvements, and reduced compulsive feeding and nicotine-seeking behaviors.

Original SEC Filing: MIRA PHARMACEUTICALS, INC. [ MIRA ] - 8-K - Jul. 06, 2026

